Ten-year-old Jenny Kim and her two buddies, Fen Stenson and Barker Mifflin, live in the town of Nevermind, where strange happenings are so normal that finding a mysterious thing growing in your armpit isn’t even considered a big deal. But when the mysterious thing gets so big Jenny has to haul it around in a wheelbarrow, it’s cause for concern. She’s going to need some help sorting this out! Enter Fen Stenson and Barker Mifflin—dancing Swedish exchange student and doomsday prepper extraordinaire—and you’ve got a team of friends made for the moment.Go with Jenny, Fen, and Barker as they visit an abandoned chemistry lab, discover curious creatures called Snerbs, and uncover a secret so big it might just eat the entire planet. It could happen!","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/aGyumrpWTxZtHY0PBnkl6YvHWeAPJ4O-sujgPPr6tqQ.mp3","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/042msOU7EqPm_pIee9-mXrjELBhsUvJH0Kba1cbxb-Y"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":9564,"fileSize":154646416,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2025-08-05T10:54:28.967Z"}},"cardId":"6okaA","createdAt":"2024-11-28T10:02:21.258Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-05T14:25:00.738Z"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}